<title>NEW ZEALAND: Tranz Rail dividend pay date now March 11.</title>
<headline>Tranz Rail dividend pay date now March 11.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tranz Rail Holdings Ltd on Tuesday said the 1997 full-year 17 NZ cents per share dividend declared on February 20 and payable to shareholders registered at March 7 would now be paid on March 11.</p>
<p>The dividend payment date had previously been announced as March 14. --Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
